n><option>Wheelchair</option><option>Ambulatory</option><option>Stretcher</option></select></div></div><div class="field"><label for="service">Service Type</label><div class="control"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-calendar"/></svg><select id="service"><option value="">Select service</option><option>Recurring Dialysis</option><option>One-Time Ride</option><option>Companion Assistance</option></select></div></div><button class="search-btn" type="submit"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-search"/></svg>Search</button></div><div class="finder-points"><div class="point"><span class="point-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-check"/></svg></span><div><b>Independent Providers</b><span>We connect you with local providers</span></div></div><div class="point"><span class="point-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-user"/></svg></span><div><b>Specialized for Dialysis</b><span>Experienced in recurring care</span></div></div><div class="point"><span class="point-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-dollar"/></svg></span><div><b>Free to Use</b><span>No booking fees or markups</span></div></div></div></form></div></section><section class="directory-note"><div class="container"><div class="shield-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-shield"/></svg></div><p><strong>Ride2Dialysis.com is an independent medical transportation directory.</strong> We help you find local providers.<br>We are not a transportation provider and do not provide transportation services.</p></div></section><section id="how" class="section"><div class="container"><h2>How It Works</h2><div class="steps"><article class="step"><div class="step-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-pin"/></svg></div><div><div class="step-title"><span class="num">1</span>Search Your Area</div><p>Enter your ZIP code and tell us what you need. We'll show providers who service your area.</p></div></article><article class="step"><div class="step-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-list"/></svg></div><div><div class="step-title"><span class="num">2</span>Compare Providers</div><p>View profiles, services, vehicle options, ratings, and accessibility features side-by-side.</p></div></article><article class="step"><div class="step-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-phone"/></svg></div><div><div class="step-title"><span class="num">3</span>Contact Directly</div><p>Reach out to providers directly to ask questions and schedule your rides.</p></div></article></div></div></section><section id="providers" class="providers-section"><div class="container"><div class="providers-head"><h2>Featured Dialysis Transportation Providers</h2><a class="view-all" href="#providers">View all providers&nbsp; →</a></div><div class="cards"><article class="card"><div class="vehicle-frame"><img class="vehicle-photo" src="provider-1.webp?v=2" alt="White wheelchair-accessible medical transportation van"></div><div class="card-body"><h3>CareRide Medical Transport</h3><div class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★★</span> &nbsp;4.9 (124)</div><div class="place">⌖ Chicago, IL</div><div class="tags"><span class="tag">Wheelchair</span><span class="tag">Ambulatory</span><span class="tag">Stretcher</span></div><button class="profile">View Profile &nbsp;→</button></div></article><article class="card"><div class="vehicle-frame"><img class="vehicle-photo" src="provider-2.webp?v=2" alt="CareRide dialysis transportation van"></div><div class="card-body"><h3>Metro Dialysis Rides</h3><div class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★★</span> &nbsp;4.8 (98)</div><div class="place">⌖ Naperville, IL</div><div class="tags"><span class="tag">Wheelchair</span><span class="tag">Ambulatory</span></div><button class="profile">View Profile &nbsp;→</button></div></article><article class="card"><div class="vehicle-frame"><img class="vehicle-photo" src="provider-3.webp?v=2" alt="Black medical transportation van"></div><div class="card-body"><h3>North Shore Transit</h3><div class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★★</span> &nbsp;4.8 (76)</div><div class="place">⌖ Evanston, IL</div><div class="tags"><span class="tag">Wheelchair</span><span class="tag">Stretcher</span></div><button class="profile">View Profile &nbsp;→</button></div></article><article class="card"><div class="vehicle-frame"><img class="vehicle-photo" src="provider-4.webp?v=2" alt="Wheelchair-lift transportation van"></div><div class="card-body"><h3>Companion Care Transport</h3><div class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★★</span> &nbsp;4.7 (63)</div><div class="place">⌖ Schaumburg, IL</div><div class="tags"><span class="tag">Wheelchair</span><span class="tag">Ambulatory</span><span class="tag">Stretcher</span></div><button class="profile">View Profile &nbsp;→</button></div></article></div></div></section><section class="benefits-section"><div class="container"><h2>Benefits of Specialized Dialysis Transportation</h2><div class="benefits"><div class="benefit"><div class="benefit-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-calendar"/></svg></div><b>On-Time, Every Time</b><p>Dependable rides for your recurring appointments.</p></div><div class="benefit"><div class="benefit-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-wheelchair"/></svg></div><b>Accessibility First</b><p>Wheelchair, stretcher, and ambulatory options.</p></div><div class="benefit"><div class="benefit-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-shield"/></svg></div><b>Safe &amp; Comfortable</b><p>Providers experienced in medical transportation.</p></div><div class="benefit"><div class="benefit-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-people"/></svg></div><b>Compassionate Service</b><p>Patient-focused care from pickup to drop-off.</p></div><div class="benefit"><div class="benefit-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-clock"/></svg></div><b>Flexible Scheduling</b><p>Early mornings, evenings, and recurring rides.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="cities" class="popular"><div class="container"><h2>Popular Searches</h2><div class="cities-row"><a class="city" href="#finder"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-pin"/></svg>Chicago, IL</a><a class="city" href="#finder"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-pin"/></svg>Naperville, IL</a><a class="city" href="#finder"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-pin"/></svg>Evanston, IL</a><a class="city" href="#finder"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-pin"/></svg>Schaumburg, IL</a><a class="city" href="#finder"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-pin"/></svg>Aurora, IL</a><a class="city" href="#finder">Browse all cities →</a></div><div class="popular-note">Or enter your ZIP code above to find providers near you.</div></div></section></main><footer id="contact" class="footer"><div class="container footer-grid"><div><div class="footer-brand">Ride2Dialysis.com</div><p>Connecting dialysis patients with independent transportation providers you can trust.</p></div><div><h4>Quick Links</h4><a href="#home">Home</a><a href="#finder">Find a Ride</a><a href="#providers">Providers</a><a href="#cities">Cities</a><a href="#how">How It Works</a></div><div><h4>For Providers</h4><a href="#contact">Add Your Company</a><a href="#contact">Provider Resources</a><a href="#contact">FAQs</a><a href="#contact">Contact Us</a></div><div><h4>Contact</h4><p>☎ (888) 555-0123</p><p>✉ info@ride2dialysis.com</p><p>◷ Mon–Fri: 8:00 AM–6:00 PM CT</p></div><div><h4>Disclaimer</h4><p>Ride2Dialysis.com is an independent directory and is not a transportation provider. We do not provide or arrange transportation services.</p></div></div><div class="copyright">© 2026 Ride2Dialysis.com. All rights reserved. &nbsp;&nbsp; Privacy Policy &nbsp; | &nbsp; Terms of Use</div></footer><div id="toast" class="toast" role="status">Showing featured providers. Full directory search is coming next.</div><script> const menuButton=document.querySelector('.menu-button');const mobilePanel=document.getElementById('mobilePanel'); menuButton.addEventListener('click',()=>{const open=mobilePanel.classList.toggle('open');menuButton.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(open));menuButton.textContent=open?'×':'☰'}); mobilePanel.querySelectorAll('a').forEach(a=>a.addEventListener('click',()=>{mobilePanel.classList.remove('open');menuButton.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');menuButton.textContent='☰'})); document.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(!mobilePanel.contains(e.target)&&!menuButton.contains(e.target)&&mobilePanel.classList.contains('open')){mobilePanel.classList.remove('open');menuButton.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');menuButton.textContent='☰'}}); document.getElementById('finder').addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();document.getElementById('providers').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'});showToast('Showing featured providers. Full directory search is coming next.')}); document.querySelectorAll('.profile').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>showToast('Provider profiles are being connected to the directory.'))); function showToast(message){const t=document.getElementById('toast');t.textContent=message;t.classList.add('show');clearTimeout(window.__toast);window.__toast=setTimeout(()=>t.classList.remove('show'),3000)} </script></body></html>